Package: lolcommits-server
Version: @VERSION@
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Neale Swinnerton <neale@sw1nn.com>
Homepage: https://code.sw1nn.net/sw1nn/lolcommits-rs
Description: Server daemon for processing lolcommits images
 Receives webcam snapshots taken at git commit time, processes them and
 serves the resulting gallery.
 .
 This package ships the daemon and its gallery static assets. The systemd
 unit is deployed and parameterised by configuration management, so it is
 deliberately not included here.
Depends: @DEPENDS@
